{"seq":1,"slug":"function-composition","title":"函数组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/function-composition","wordCount":767,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"函数组合\">函数组合</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>函数组合</strong>用一个小圆圈 <code>∘</code> 把两个函数焊成一个：先应用 <code>g</code>，再把结果交给 <code>f</code>。它是函数式编程最基本的&quot;粘合剂&quot;，也是从柯里化到 Monad 的公共基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组合</td>\n<td><code>(f ∘ g)(x) = f(g(x))</code></td>\n<td>小函数拼成大函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td><code>(f ∘ g) ∘ h = f ∘ (g ∘ h)</code></td>\n<td>组合链可自由分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位元</td>\n<td><code>f ∘ id = id ∘ f = f</code></td>\n<td><code>identity</code> 可随时插入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型对齐</td>\n<td>前一个的输出类型 = 后一个的输入类型</td>\n<td>组合在编译期可检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范畴</td>\n<td>类型是对象，函数是态射</td>\n<td>组合的代数解释</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>组合的价值在于&quot;小步构建&quot;：每个函数只做一件事，再用组合把职责串起来，而不是写一个庞大的一次性函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合的数学基础\">组合的数学基础</h2><p><strong>函数组合</strong>（Function Composition）源自数学中的复合函数概念。给定函数 <code>f: B → C</code> 和 <code>g: A → B</code>，它们的组合 <code>f ∘ g</code> 定义为 <code>(f ∘ g)(x) = f(g(x))</code>。组合产生一个新函数，先应用 <code>g</code>，再将结果传给 <code>f</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"(.) :: (b -&gt; c) -&gt; (a -&gt; b) -&gt; a -&gt; c&#10;(f . g) x = f (g x)&#10;&#10;toUpperFirst :: String -&gt; String&#10;toUpperFirst = toUpper . head\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(.) :: (b -> c) -> (a -> b) -> a -> c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(f . g) x = f (g x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>toUpperFirst :: String -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>toUpperFirst = toUpper . head</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const compose =&#10;  &lt;A, B, C&gt;(f: (b: B) =&gt; C, g: (a: A) =&gt; B): ((a: A) =&gt; C) =&gt;&#10;  (a: A) =&gt;&#10;    f(g(a));&#10;&#10;const toUpper = (s: string): string =&gt; s.toUpperCase();&#10;const exclaim = (s: string): string =&gt; `${s}!`;&#10;&#10;const shout = compose(exclaim, toUpper);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">g</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toUpper</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> exclaim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}!`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(exclaim, toUpper);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td>组合顺序不影响结果</td>\n<td><code>(f ∘ g) ∘ h = f ∘ (g ∘ h)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位元</td>\n<td>identity 函数是组合的单位元</td>\n<td><code>f ∘ id = id ∘ f = f</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型对齐</td>\n<td>前一个函数的输出类型 = 后一个的输入</td>\n<td><code>g: A→B, f: B→C ⇒ f∘g: A→C</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    X[&quot;A&quot;] --&gt;|g| Y[&quot;B&quot;]&#10;    Y --&gt;|f| Z[&quot;C&quot;]&#10;    X --&gt;|&quot;f ∘ g&quot;| Z\">graph LR\n    X[\"A\"] --&gt;|g| Y[\"B\"]\n    Y --&gt;|f| Z[\"C\"]\n    X --&gt;|\"f ∘ g\"| Z</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 函数组合的结合律意味着 <code>compose(f, compose(g, h))</code> 与 <code>compose(compose(f, g), h)</code> 完全等价。这使得我们可以自由地分组和重组组合链，不必担心结果改变。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多函数组合\">多函数组合</h2><p>实际开发中往往需要组合多个函数。可以通过 <code>reduce</code> 实现任意数量函数的组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const composeMany = &lt;A&gt;(...fns: Array&lt;(a: A) =&gt; A&gt;): ((a: A) =&gt; A) =&gt; fns.reduce((f, g) =&gt; (x: A) =&gt; f(g(x)));&#10;&#10;const processString = composeMany(&#10;  (s: string) =&gt; s.trim(),&#10;  (s: string) =&gt; s.toLowerCase(),&#10;  (s: string) =&gt; s.replace(/\\s+/g, &#39;-&#39;),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> composeMany</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fns.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--sh