le=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fnCategory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  compose:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">g</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> C</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>范畴的三条公理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>验证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td><code>(f ∘ g) ∘ h = f ∘ (g ∘ h)</code></td>\n<td>展开定义可证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左单位元</td>\n<td><code>id ∘ f = f</code></td>\n<td><code>id(f(x)) = f(x)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右单位元</td>\n<td><code>f ∘ id = f</code></td>\n<td><code>f(id(x)) = f(x)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((函数组合))&#10;    数学基础&#10;      复合函数&#10;      结合律&#10;      单位元 identity&#10;    实现方式&#10;      二元 compose&#10;      多函数 composeMany&#10;      reduceRight&#10;    类型安全&#10;      泛型重载&#10;      fp-ts flow&#10;      Haskell 完整推断&#10;    代数结构&#10;      范畴论&#10;      类型是对象&#10;      函数是态射\">mindmap\n  root((函数组合))\n    数学基础\n      复合函数\n      结合律\n      单位元 identity\n    实现方式\n      二元 compose\n      多函数 composeMany\n      reduceRight\n    类型安全\n      泛型重载\n      fp-ts flow\n      Haskell 完整推断\n    代数结构\n      范畴论\n      类型是对象\n      函数是态射</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>函数组合</strong>将两个函数连接为一个新函数，是函数式编程最基本的构建操作。</li>\n<li>组合满足<strong>结合律</strong>且以 <code>identity</code> 为单位元，这些代数性质保证了组合的灵活性。</li>\n<li>TypeScript 中实现类型安全的组合需要泛型重载或 fp-ts 等库的支持。</li>\n<li>从范畴论视角看，类型和函数构成一个范畴，组合是态射的复合操作。</li>\n<li>掌握函数组合是理解后续柯里化、管道和 Monad 等概念的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"函数组合","id":"函数组合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"组合的数学基础","id":"组合的数学基础"},{"level":2,"text":"多函数组合","id":"多函数组合"},{"level":2,"text":"组合与类型安全","id":"组合与类型安全"},{"level":2,"text":"组合的代数结构","id":"组合的代数结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"引用透明性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/referential-transparency"},"next":{"title":"柯里化与偏应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/currying-and-partial"}}